# ARTIC VMS — Complete Landing Page Specification

The ARTIC VMS landing page should introduce the entire platform, attract companies and individual vehicle owners, help customers discover transport services, and guide drivers and other professionals into the correct registration or sign-in process.

The most important design principle: ARTIC should have one public landing page, one shared identity system, and different dashboards based on each user's verified roles and permissions. A person must not need a new account simply because they become a driver, vehicle owner, company administrator, or customer.

